3. THIRD-PARTY DATA — NO LICENCE GRANTED

   No licence is granted for any third-party data, and nothing in this
   repository transfers rights in it. This includes data from, or derived
   from:

   - EOD Historical Data (EODHD) end-of-day prices and catalogues;
   - Tiingo end-of-day prices;
   - Kalshi market data (public API);
   - Open Source Asset Pricing (OSAP) portfolio returns and signal
     documentation, by Andrew Y. Chen and Tom Zimmermann.

   Raw third-party data is not included. Derived statistics that appear in
   reports (aggregate returns, counts, test statistics) are provided for
   research reference only, and remain subject to each provider's terms. To
   reproduce any result, obtain the data from the provider under your own
   licence or account.

   Results based on OSAP data must cite:
   Chen, A. Y., and Zimmermann, T. (2022). Open Source Cross-Sectional Asset
   Pricing. Critical Finance Review, 11(2), 207-264.

   Fama-French factor and portfolio data come from the Kenneth R. French
   Data Library and are likewise not licensed by this repository.

Nothing in this repository is investment advice.
